          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka ugira icumi na kabiri, ku musi w’icumi na gatanu w’ukwezi kw’icumi na kabiri, ijambo ry’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ryatumwe kuri jewe riti: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwana w’Umuntu, borogera amasinzi y’ingabo za Egiputa, n’ayandi mahanga akomeye. Kuko nzobarungika i kuzimu mw’isi y’abapfuye hamwe n’abamanuka baja muri rwa rwobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubabwire uti: ‘Mbega hari ico musumbije abandi? Manuka murambararane n’abatakebwe.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanyegiputa bazogwa hagati mu bishwe n’inkota. Inkota irasokowe, reka Abanyegiputa bakweganwe n’amasinzi y’ingabo zabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hariya i kuzimu, iwabo w’abapfuye, abandi batware bakomeye bazovugira i kuzimu ivya Egiputa n’abifatanije na ho bavuge bati: ‘Baraje i kuzimu kurambararana n’abatakebwe, ari bo batikijwe n’inkota.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashuri arambarayeyo ari kumwe n’ingabo ziwe zose; akikujwe n’imva z’abo yishe bose, abo yaririkishije inkota. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imva zabo ziri i bwina mu rwobo, kandi ingabo ziwe zandagaye i ruhande y’imva yiwe. Abari bakwije iterabwoba kw’isi y’abazima bose, barishwe, barigitwa n’inkota.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elamu ni yo ari, akikujwe n’imva z’ingabo ziwe. Bose barishwe, barigiswe n’inkota. Abari bakwije iterabwoba kw’isi y’abazima bamanutse i kuzimu badakebwe. Bajanyeyo ibimaramare vyabo bari kumwe n’abaja mu rwobo i kuzimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yateguriwe uburiri hagati y’abandi bishwe, imva yiwe ikikujwe n’isinzi ry’ingabo ziwe. Bose ntibari barakebwe, kandi bishwe n’inkota. Kubera ko iterabwoba ryabo ryakwiye kw’isi y’abazima, bajanyeyo ibimaramare vyabo, bajana n’abaja mu rwobo i kuzimu; barambaraye hamwe n’abishwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mesheki na Tubali ni yo bari, imva zabo zikikujwe n’amasinzi y’ingabo zabo. Bose ntibari barakebwe, kandi barigiswe n’inkota, kuko bakwije iterabwoba ryabo kw’isi yose y’abazima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko ntibahambanywe iteka nk’abandi bahizi ba kera bamanutse i kuzimu batwaye ibigwanisho vyabo, bagaseguzwa inkota zabo, bakagerekwako n’inkinzo zabo; naho abo bahizi na bo nyene bari barateye ubwoba isi yose y’abazima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
